        st:refersToColumn e:u-t01-c005 ;
        st:text "Some participants (n~40), who consent to participate in an optional sub-study, will undergo X-ray for assessment of joints (Section 8.1.2.3). For German sites please refer to Germany Appendix (Section 10.11.2.4)." .

    e:u-t01-n-x2a-r017 a st:UnifiedAnnotation ;
